      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Configuration.ConnectionStoreOptions",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Configuration.ConnectionStoreOptions.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Tuning for connection record state-store TTL. The WSM sets a Dapr\n<code>ttlInSeconds</code> on every connection record write.\n<xref href=\"Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.ConnectionHeartbeatService\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> refreshes it for\nevery locally-owned, connected connection every TTL/3 seconds\n(floored at 10s), independent of send traffic; a successful\n<code>Send</code>/<code>SendRaw</code> also refreshes it as a side effect.\nRecords whose TTL elapses (e.g. a pod that died without a clean\ndisconnect, so nothing is heartbeating them anymore) are removed\nby the state store without explicit reclaimer intervention.</p>\n"
    },
