      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.ApiLifecyclePublisher",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.ApiLifecyclePublisher.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Publishes connection lifecycle events to the virtufin-api's\n<code>system-events</code> topic. Events are CloudEvents v1.0 envelopes\nwith the WSM's URN as the source. The publisher is best-effort:\nfailures are logged but never propagated, so an unreachable API\ndoes not break the WSM's local connection state machine.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
