      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.AppMetrics",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Virtufin.WebSocketManager.Services.AppMetrics.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Application-level metrics for the WebSocketManager service. Mirrors the\npattern in <code>Virtufin.WorkManager.Services.AppMetrics</code>. Counters are\nregistered under the meter <code>Virtufin.WebSocketManager</code>, which is\nalready wired into the OpenTelemetry pipeline in <code>Program.cs</code>.</p>\n"
    },
